{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vindefiant is a pixel-art adventure game where players take on the role of Alyx, a corprate employee who unexpectedly grows supernatural powers. Disgruntled having been fired from his job, Alyx unleashes his powers and sparks a path of rage and destruction to get revenge on his former employer. Anyone who happens to cross his path will meet a gruesome end. In Vindefiant, you are the bad guy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786020/extras/stGif3.5.gif?t=1744646756\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In your journey for vengeance, you will need to traverse through various environments, including an office building, streets, and sewers. Use your villainous powers to quickly cause havoc. Your tendrils can be used to grab objects to hurtle towards enemies, throw enemies through windows, into ventilation fans, smash open doors, tear apart turrets, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786020/extras/stGif4.1.gif?t=1744646756\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you explore your powers you'll unlock new abilities, giving you greater options to create as much destruction and death as possible. Alyx is determined to get his revenge for losing his job, and you choose exactly how he\u2019ll get there. But at what cost?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786020/extras/stFeatures.png?t=1744646756\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A narrative driven, single player experience following a journey of chaos, twists and a protagonist willing to unleash evil to get what he wants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique set of platforming controls<strong>,</strong> with the ability to glide across almost any wall or ceiling to unleash your rage on the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alyx uses a tendril to latch onto enemies, desk chairs, traffic lights, sewer pipes, doors and countless other objects. Enjoy creative freedom as you find new ways to kill every time you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A plot of revenge that spans 9 chapters and leads players across different environments, ranging from a city at sunset to a dark, winding sewer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 80 collectibles to be found as you traverse through chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786020/extras/stGif6.gif?t=1744646756\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Scaling To Fall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2786020/12f23e24936585b608d1518504902026a36d3805.jpg"},{"name":"Darkness Awakened","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2786020/47e6d22c2f27526d8558a35eb6f8987b3d4752c6.jpg"},{"name":"Collateral Damage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2786020/e44c5a5edf40238f9d9a9b1f219e0810b11222a3.jpg"},{"name":"Vengeance?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2786020/7ad1bfaaa3ce4e8c77fd21f1ec6e3b415772bc5a.jpg"},{"name":"A Moment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2786020/158fb5301bd833621f9dd947c52c564146caa1c7.jpg"},{"name":"Where you belong","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2786020/7fba0bc316cb1f9eeac3043b3ab6a275200409af.jpg"},{"name":"Data disrupted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2786020/91fcf9adf6b894b5b297b39ad942933d09579c0b.jpg"},{"name":"The grip of consequence","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2786020/20768cc439cc0ccd0e375ec1480acc6dcb86eac2.jpg"},{"name":"To lose is to gain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2786020/55338a9bfc60b85cd9785d63defa5dcce5601a36.jpg"},{"name":"Backfired","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2786020/4a4a887889b9bc524b592cd2c85a3cc93f5457fd.jpg"}],"total":39},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2786020?t=1744646756","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2786020?t=1744646756","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786020/2e0cf0e261f3029f44471e55f3ffa586630cc3db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744646756","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786020/2e0cf0e261f3029f44471e55f3ffa586630cc3db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744646756","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Vindefiant includes gory content, specifically regarding violence towards enemies."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vindefiant is a pixel-art adventure game where players take on the role of Alyx, a corprate employee who unexpectedly grows supernatural powers. Disgruntled having been fired from his job, Alyx unleashes his powers and sparks a path of rage and destruction to get revenge on his former employer. Anyone who happens to cross his path will meet a gruesome end. In Vindefiant, you are the bad guy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786020/extras/stGif3.5.gif?t=1744646756\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In your journey for vengeance, you will need to traverse through various environments, including an office building, streets, and sewers. Use your villainous powers to quickly cause havoc. Your tendrils can be used to grab objects to hurtle towards enemies, throw enemies through windows, into ventilation fans, smash open doors, tear apart turrets, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786020/extras/stGif4.1.gif?t=1744646756\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you explore your powers you'll unlock new abilities, giving you greater options to create as much destruction and death as possible. Alyx is determined to get his revenge for losing his job, and you choose exactly how he\u2019ll get there. But at what cost?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786020/extras/stFeatures.png?t=1744646756\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A narrative driven, single player experience following a journey of chaos, twists and a protagonist willing to unleash evil to get what he wants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique set of platforming controls<strong>,</strong> with the ability to glide across almost any wall or ceiling to unleash your rage on the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alyx uses a tendril to latch onto enemies, desk chairs, traffic lights, sewer pipes, doors and countless other objects. Enjoy creative freedom as you find new ways to kill every time you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A plot of revenge that spans 9 chapters and leads players across different environments, ranging from a city at sunset to a dark, winding sewer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 80 collectibles to be found as you traverse through chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786020/extras/stGif6.gif?t=1744646756\" /></p>","developers":["Blakey Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786020/header.jpg?t=1744646756","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> glibc 2.17+, 32/64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 M380<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.0+ (2.1 with ARB extensions acceptable)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Lion 10.7.5, 32/64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 M380<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.0+ (2.1 with ARB extensions acceptable)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257012401,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257012401/movie480.mp4?t=1728619160","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257012401/movie_max.mp4?t=1728619160"},"name":"Vindefiant Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257012401/e5d62fb0478c4a391d5387400721bffe0a3